window.products.push({"id":451046,"name":"Whiskey Stones Stainless Steel Ice Cubes Reusable Chilling Whiskey Stones Beverage Rocks with Tongs & Freezer Storage Tray for Whiskey Wine Beverage, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715czd5LA9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Grade Safety Material: Whiskey stones are made of high quality food grade 304 stainless steel, No organic synthetic compounds (like BPA) added. They are durable and reusable, stainless steel ice cubes will never rust or corrode or perforate and can be used for a long time. Not Affect Flavor: Chill without dilution, high-quality stainless steel structure so you don't have to worry about ice cubes melting and watering your drink. Our whiskey stones is 100% premium food grade and give no added taste or smell to your beverage, keep the original taste of the wine, also will not affect the flavor of the beverage, retains cool temperature. Easy to Use: Just freeze for 2-3 hours and use in beverage. Wash with hot water before use to ensure effective disinfection. 8 reusable stainless steel ice cubes are filled with food grade liquid, with a tongs and a freezer storage tray included. Non-slip rubber end ice tongs to help prevent metal ice cubes from being scratched when picked up. The plastic storage tray keeps your whiskey stones clean and organizes them during freezing. Just simply water wash or neutral detergent wash after use. Perfect Gifts: Stylish simplicity appearance makes our whiskey stones ideal for any gift-giving occasion. Smooth bright stainless steel cubes, will not scratch your drinkware, do not hit your teeth, will not be swallowed. They are durable and dishwasher safe, always maintain their original appearance. Great for Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas and more. Essential accessories for bars and parties, and special gifts for all your loved ones. Widely Used: Can be used for Irish Whiskey, Scotch, Japanese Whiskey, Tennessee Whiskey, rye or bourbon and vodka, brandy, rum, liqueurs, white wine, beer, coffee, juice, even all kinds of drinking. Fast-cooling, non-diluting, stainless steel ice cubes with rounded edges that won't scratch your glass. Can be used at home, office, bar and party to enjoy relaxation time. Can also be used for sprain, fever reduction, cold compress and swelling reduction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715czd5LA9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOOVUS","source_asin":"B07ZR9X8S8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZR9X8S8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZR9X8S8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
