window.products.push({"id":451070,"name":"TEESHLY Handmade Dream Catcher Feather Car Interior Rearview Mirror Small Boho Car Charms Pendant Decor Wall Hanging Ornaments (Boho-Brown Circle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71obqhXAerL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade Decoration - Dream Catcher Net for Wall Hanging Ornament Dreamcatcher originated in the North American tribe formerly known as the Ojibwa nation. It is said that both good dreams and bad dreams circulate in the night air. by hanging a Dream Catcher over or around your sleeping area, the bad dreams will be deterred by the beads in the catcher and the feathers will attract and allow the good dreams to pass through. IN native american culture，a dream catcher is a handmade object based on a willow hoop, on which is woven a loose net or web.There's a lot of meaning in the dream catcher: their shape is the circle of life and according to some legends, the beads represent the spider who wove the dream catcher. Dream Catchers bring in positive energy in your life. Why choose our Boho Dream Catchers Pendant ? Made of a soft and environmental material. Exquisite and meaningful gifts for who you really care. Perfect Pendant art and indispensable decoration for home. A pretty hanging decor for party, boho wedding ,kids teepee tent hanging in your car, bedroom, sitting room, balcony, wall, window and outdoors. Warm feeling -- Not only can bring warm and love to your family but also catch the sweet dreams and let you enjoy the sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71obqhXAerL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEESHLY","source_asin":"B0BSD92MPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451070","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSD92MPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSD92MPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
