window.products.push({"id":451140,"name":"2 Pack Silicone Utensil Rest with Large Drip Pad 8 Slots ULG Heat-Resistant 428℉ Silicone Spoon Rest, 10''x 8.5'' Spoon Rest & Spoon Holder for Stove ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715q2spVH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8 Slots for Multiple Utensils - Compared with the 4-slot spoon rest on the market, our 8-slot kitchen utensil rest has more space and multiple slots to park your cooking utensils , can easily accommodate even your largest cooking and serving tools. This spatula holder for countertop holds up to 8 full-sized spoons or spatulas at once, reducing the amount of space needed when multitasking in the kitchen and no more messes. Wider Drip Pad - Our utensil rest for stove top has wider drip pad than others, perfect for holding multiple and large utensils when cooking. You never worry about large tableware taking up too much space or one utensil mixing with the others. With edge leak-proof design, the stove top spoon holder can prevent spills from flowing to the countertop, keep your countertop clean and neat. Less hassle than using paper towels. Easy to Clean - When the cooking is done, the non slip spatula holder can simply be threw in the dishwasher for an easy cleanup. You also can wipe it with a damp cloth or rinse by water if there is jam, spaghetti sauce on it. Heat-Resistant Silicone - Made of food-grade silicone, the spoon rest features a high heat resistance range up to 428℉, non-toxic and BPA-free, safe and durable. The heat-resistant holder can be placed near the stove or counter top, it won't slip, slide or melt while you're cooking. Widely Used - This kitchen utensil rest is an essential cooking tool for any home chef, great for cooking, grilling and baking. You also can carry it to camp. Our grill utensil holder is functional for spoon, spatula, brush, fork, barbecue clip and other dripping utensils. No more oily messes on your counter or grill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715q2spVH8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ULG","source_asin":"B0BPQW8GQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPQW8GQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPQW8GQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
