window.products.push({"id":451298,"name":"DreamDNA King 8 Inch Thick AmericanMade Mattress with 4\" Gel Infused Visco Elastic Memory Foam","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6184eHO0YZL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Memory foam's ability to reduce pressure points is one of the reasons so many people are using it to get the best night's sleep. Now you can enjoy the benefits of memory foam and the cooling properties of Gel by buying one of the hottest items on the market since memory foam was invented. This Gel Infused Mattress will add comfort, help you sleep cooler and increase the quality of sleep immediately. The four inches of Gel Infused memory foam used in this mattress is specifically designed to elminate pressure points, reduce motion transfer and also provides additional support in areas where you need it the most for proper spinal alignment. The foam is also specially formulated to contour to your body at any temperature, and will give you the extra cooling comfort you need to get the best night's sleep possible from your new mattress. Our Gel Infused memory foam has also earned the PURGreen certification, which means they are manufactured, fabricated and packaged in the U.S.A. meeting all EPA and CSPC standards being safe and free from harmful chemicals found in many imported products. PURGreen uses independent laboratory results to qualify products and ensure they are manufactured without the use of ozone-depleting substances such as Chlorofluorocarbans, Polybrominated Diphenyl Ether substances, Harmful Metals, Formaldehyde, Prohibited Phalates or any other unsafe materials. PURGreen also implements baseline requirements such as conserving water, energy and other natural resources in the manufacturing processes established through internationally accepted ISO standards and procedures.***There may be a new foam smell associated with your new mattress; however, this odor is not toxic or harmful passing all PurGreen, EPA and CSPC standards. MADE IN THE USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6184eHO0YZL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American","source_asin":"B00K9WZTV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K9WZTV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K9WZTV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
