window.products.push({"id":451505,"name":"Pipe Smoke Wax Petals, Soy Wax Melt, 2 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obiE8uTVL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"About the Scent: This fragrance is a smoky tobacco leaf having notes of herbaceous tobacco leaf followed by a touch of sweet honey and finishing with a smoky, leathery cedar wood, fresh cherry wood, and vanilla bean. Masculine, refreshing, and soothing. About our melts: This wickless soy wax melts quickly to produce room-filling fragrance in minutes. It works in all electric and non-electric warmers or simply place a ceramic dish with a melt cube on your stove where it gets warm enough to melt. Contains 6 petals of wax or 2 oz Each pack of 6 petals lasts up to 90 hours of scent. About the quality: We use only the best quality pure soy wax and pthlate free natural fragrance oils in our tarts/wax melts. *NOTE* Wax color may vary. Flowers, vase, ceramic melter, etc. not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obiE8uTVL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beffermade","source_asin":"B0842C5LTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842C5LTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842C5LTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
