window.products.push({"id":451542,"name":"HIMOX Air Purifiers for Home Large Room, H13 HEPA Filter Activated Carbon Air Cleaner for Odor Smell Dust Pollen Mold Spore","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lokm4eMYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️ AIR PURIFIERS FOR LARGE ROOM - It is designed with CADR 300+ (m³/h) and can refresh indoor air up to 1096 sq ft / 100 m² room within 1 h ☑️ 3-STAGE AIR FILTRATION SYSTEM - the pre-filter, H13 HEPA filter and activated carbon layer abosorbs 99.97% particles with 0.3 microns size, such as smoke, dust, pollen, mold spore, pet odor. It can eases all kinds of allergies caused by airborne contaminants such as sneezing, congestion. 👉 Search for B0B6HP6X42 👈 ☑️ QUIET AIR PURIFIER - in SLEEP mode, the noise level is only 21 dB, hence you can easily forget the running air purifier and start the good night rest. You can also change the fan to higher running mode. The whispering-like white noise in near 30 dB will fit you perfectly ☑️ AIR QUALITY INDICATOR & AUTO MODE - built-in PM2.5 sensor will make the air quality display in different colors. Choose the auto mode, then this smart air purifier will auto-adjust the fan speed to fit the air quality around. It helps to save energy cost and expand the filter lifespan ☑️ WIFI REMOTE CONTROL - The WiFi control makes it easier to set the room air purifier in any time any where. It is very easy to connect WiFi. You can set schedual, timer or change running mode via APP ☑️ SAFE CERTIFIED & PORTABLE - CARB Certified, FCC Certified, and ETL Listed, 🔷[HIMOX which is supported by US based company provides customer service in USA.]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lokm4eMYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIMOX","source_asin":"B0BYZPBMVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYZPBMVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYZPBMVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
