window.products.push({"id":451599,"name":"Personalized Ceramic Color Changing Coffee Mug 11oz Heat Sensitive Cup Add Your Photo Text Logo Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vjMiaO-1L._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Product: Personalized Heat Mug Gift--Color Changing Coffee Cup with Customized Picture Cup & Foldable Spoon Set Material: ceramics  Size: 9.5*8.2cm/3.7*3.2 inch  Capacity: 300-400ml  Weight: 350g   * Color Changing: When the mug is cold, its dull black, and when you pour into hot water or other hot drinks, the color and pattern will change with heat  * Reusable: The mug will go back to black when temperature cools down and it will do this cycle forever as long as it's not damaged. Only when the temperature is over 122 Fahrenheit degree can it show the magic  * Notice: Handwash only,do not machine wash,do not use a scouring agent,do not soak for long periods of time,otherwise the wrapping on the mug might come off,please know this before wash  * Birthday/Christmas Gift: Perfect gift for those who are hard to buy for! Mug printed with your selective photo that represents your most memoriable/happy/excited moment.What a cool, nolvety and brilliant gift! And it will be fun to be able to see how full it is from the outside How to place an custom order ? Step 1: Select \"COLOR\" you like; Step 2: Click \"Cutomize Now\" to upload your selective photo in .JPEG format; To ensure perfect appearance and experience, the photo's pixel should be as high as possible Step 3: Add to cart when you've done the personalized details and have double checked it Plus Words : * Photo puzzle plus is not suggested since the pixel may not meet the pixel requirements  * If you place an order without any personized information and didn't contact us within 48 hours,your order will be shipped in blank original one  * Unless there's quality problem,otherwise,any kinds of cancellation or return won't be acceptable when the customized product is well done","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vjMiaO-1L._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonlove","source_asin":"B01N9GRAH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9GRAH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9GRAH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
