window.products.push({"id":451756,"name":"Air Fryer Silicone Liners, 5 Reusable Air Fryer Liners, Air Fryer Tray-Silicone Airfryer Basket, Safer Parchment Alternatives-Air Fryer Accessories 6 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ttKyAw5-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 Air Fryer Silicone Liners in various colors: You'll receive 5 pieces of air fryer liners in blue, green, grey, red, and black. This quantity and variety of colors are ideal for daily use and replacement. The reusable air fryer liner measures 19.5x19.5x5cm/7.6x7.6x2 inches and fits most air fryers. It is important to double-check whether the size fits your air fryer basket before ordering. ​Made From Food Grade Silicone: This Food Grade Silicone Air Fryer Basket is safe, non-toxic, and thicker without the risk of burning. The material is highly heat and oil resistant, making it durable and long-lasting, while not giving the food any weird taste or smell. These air fryer trays do not deform or tear easily and can be reused multiple times. All of this makes our silicone air fryer liners more durable, eco-friendly, and affordable than disposable parchment paper liners. Easy to clean and dishwasher safe: Silicone air fryer liner squares are easy to clean and can be washed in the dishwasher. These reusable silicone air fryer liners help to keep your air fryer free of food residue, grease, and grime without compromising the air fryer’s lifespan. This feature is very convenient and saves time and effort after cooking. Wide application: Our air fryer accessories 6 qt fits 4-7QT air fryers, and are suitable for air fryer ovens, microwaves, steamers, cookware, and more. They can be widely applied for baking, roasting, frying, or holding food. The liners are ideal for home baking, camping, barbecue, summer parties, and other occasions. These silicone pads for air fryers are a versatile and practical tool, making your life much easier. Smart Raised Lined design: The silicone oven liner features many raised lines on the bottom, which help the food to be fully and evenly heated. The raised lines also allow excess grease to leave the food, resulting in tastier, and healthier food. So our silicone liners for air fryer basket is especially useful for those who want to cook healthier meals. If you have any concerns or questions about our air fryer liners, please contact us for 100% satisfactory service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ttKyAw5-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYJAQI","source_asin":"B0BXNZJBT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXNZJBT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXNZJBT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
