window.products.push({"id":451775,"name":"Handmade with Love Labels for Canning Jars, Mason Jar Gifts and Favors, by Once Upon Supplies, Kraft Round Stickers, 2.5 Inches Size for Wide Mouth Ja","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KPKtAtsLL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"These rustic kraft brown mason jar labels are designed to complement your homemade gifts. Offered in two sizes - the 2\" size labels fit the standard size mason jars and the 2.5\" size labels fit the wide mouth jars. They will stick to both the jar lids & the glass. Printed on lightly textured kraft brown sticker paper with archival quality ink, these labels will add a lovely touch to your homemade gifts. Please note that while these labels are water-resistant, they're not waterproof. They will wrinkle with water contact. This listing is for a pack of 36 2.5\" round stickers with a \"handmade with love\" text. These stickers are perfect for adding a lovely note to your homemade holiday gifts. About Once Upon Supplies: Once Upon Supplies is a whimsical paper & lifestyle products line for the home. Since 2012, we have been making paper and lifestyle products that are both functional to use and beautiful to look at. Our product lines include labels & stickers, paper goods and gift wrap embellishments. Many of our products have a retro & rustic feel that inspires the do-it-yourself enthusiasts and evokes a sense of playfulness. Everything is designed, printed and packaged with care in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KPKtAtsLL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Once Upon Supplies","source_asin":"B018Y125LS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018Y125LS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018Y125LS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
