window.products.push({"id":451777,"name":"HAUS AND HUES New York Poster Gray Empire State NYC Wall Art New York City Wall Art NYC Skyline Wall Art Empire State Building Wall Art Black and Whit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bIpKalh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GET AN ART PRINT THAT NEVER GOES OUT OF STYLE: This Empire State print by Haus and Hues is a classic and elegant wall piece for your homes, apartments, and offices. Displaying the iconic Empire State building in monochromes makes this wall art timeless wall decor. Without the distraction of color, the grey Empire State print helps guests focus on and appreciate the other aspects of the photo: subject, composition, and texture. Plus, the monochrome adds a vintage and nostalgic feel to any room SUITS ALL STYLE & COLORWAYS: This New York City skyline print fits any style, be it retro, minimalist, hippie, glamorous, modern, or industrial. Simply hang this New York City poster using putty, double-sided poster tape or thumbtacks in your living room, dorm room, entryway, gallery wall, nursery, dining room, or kitchen, and see how it modernizes your home! If New York is your favorite city, this poster is for you! Put this on your bedroom wall to remind you of the best memories you had there EXCELLENT QUALITY & PROTECTION: Haus & Hues supports the art community worldwide. We only use Giclée printing which is far superior to all other printing forms because it holds its colors far longer than any standard prints. Each art print is printed on fine Archival Linen Paper, which is acid-free and fade-resistant. Our Manhattan print in 12” x 16” is packaged with chipboard pads to protect against creases and dents and shipped in Kraft Self-Seal StayFlats to protect your artwork in transit ORDER W/ CONFIDENCE 100% MONEY-BACK: Your satisfaction is our top priority. We have absolute faith in the quality of our wall art. Our team carefully checks all art prints in the famous Wynwood Arts District in Miami, Florida, before leaving our workshop to maintain quality assurance. If there’s any problem with your order, simply contact us, and we will refund you or offer you a replacement. With us, you always shop stress and risk-free. Either you'll love your new wall art, or it's free! CLASSIC NY GIFTS FOR MEN, WOMEN, & TEENS: The New York City skyline poster has always been iconic wall art. Give this New York wall art to your coworker, sister, mom, dad, girlfriend, boyfriend, or best friend as an anniversary, birthday, housewarming, or thinking-of-you gift. Or, perhaps this is for you, keep this as a souvenir! Recipients of this gift will appreciate how this wall art makes any space modern, stylish, and beautiful!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bIpKalh8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B09236PSLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09236PSLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09236PSLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
