window.products.push({"id":451829,"name":"MELLCOM Electric Griddle Nonstick, 35\" Extra Large Pancake Griddle With Drip Tray, 1800W Waterproof Presto Electric Griddle With 5-Level Adjustable Te","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NO+Z62NtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Fast Heat-Up & 5-Level Temperature Control】The 1800W fast heat-up nonstick electric griddle with a 5-step temperature adjustable knob allows you to adjust the cooking temperature between 210°F and 460°F, which is suitable for fried egg, steak, pancake, and barbecue. The layout of the heating element is conducive to improving the heat transfer efficiency, meanwhile the flat surface makes the food heated more evenly and brings you more delicious food. 【35\" Extra Large Griddle】Spacious 35.4\" by 9\" size is great for hosting parties or family meals. The electric skillet griddle allows you to place steaks, barbecues, bacon, kebabs, vegetables, and other foods together, which effectively improves the efficiency of grilling. Multiple people could enjoy a happy cooking and eating experience together. 【Easy To USE & Easy To Clean】Insert the plug into the socket and adjust the temperature knob to use pancake griddle. The design of detachable power cord is not only great for indoor BBQs but also suitable on camping and self-catering holidays. Our waterproof smokeless grill is applied with nonstick coating, which means when you finish your meal, you could rinse with water and then wipe dry to complete the cleaning. 【Quality Material】The pot body is made of high quality aluminum alloy with special surface treatment could heat accumulation and heat insulation. The thickeneds handle are easy to hold, which improve the convenience of handling. Meanwhile, we moderately increased the height of the footpads to increase the distance between the bottom of the bakeware and the table, effectively preventing damage to the table caused by excessive temperature. 【Extra Oil Tray & Sale Service】Our parabolic electric grill is equipped with an enlarged high-quality oil collecting tray. The detachable oil collecting tray of 4.3\" * 5.5\" * 1.38\" size is a good choice to collect excess oil. The oil collecting tray has an excellent performance in preventing oil, is very easy to clean, and effectively avoids oil residue. If you have any questions, please contact us, we will solve the problem for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NO+Z62NtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MELLCOM","source_asin":"B09DC897HD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DC897HD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DC897HD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
