window.products.push({"id":451846,"name":"Schott Zwiesel 106227 red wine glass, clear, 6 glasses.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V4cS0tASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 6 Schott Zwiesel 27.5 oz. Classico Claret Burgundy Wine Glasses Found in the world's best hotels, bars and restaurants, Classico glasses are made from the choicest crystal by Schott Zwiesel. For sale in this listing we have a set of six fine Schott Zwiesel crystal Classico line 27.5 oz. claret burgundy wine glasses. These glasses are offered here at prices sharply reduced from normal retail, made possible by a massive buyout of overstock from the manufacturer. Be sure to check all our offerings to see the full range of the crystal drinkware we have for sale. This lot features: * Set of 6 NEW in original box! * Cleaning and Care: Dishwasher Safe * Material: Scratch-Resistant Crystal * Manufacturer: Schott Zwiesel * Manufacturer No.: 8213/140 * Style: Classico * Height: 9.1 inches * Width: 4.6 inches * Size: 27.5 oz. Schott Zwiesel, the famed German producer based in one of the world's prime glass-manufacturing centers, has led the glass industry for more than 100 years. The company has many industry \"firsts\" to its credit, including the first fully automated production of blown glass stemware in 1967. In the 1990s as the industry struggled with the environmental issues of lead and heavy metals, the company was the first glassmaker to produce lead-free crystal glass of superb quality and brilliance. Its latest breakthrough is the patented Tritan technique for producing extra-strong crystalline stemware. The process combines a proprietary mix of materials with tempering of vulnerable points to create the most resilient fine stemware in the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V4cS0tASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classico","source_asin":"B0053145T8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0053145T8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0053145T8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
