window.products.push({"id":451861,"name":"Serta Triple Layer Comfort, 4-Inch Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Cal King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81axs0L+N0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pamper yourself with the luxurious experience of the Serta Triple-Layer Comfort mattress topper. It is designed to provide the ultimate in comfort and support, with the therapeutic benefits of memory foam. This topper features two layers of premium foam and a luxurious quilted cover. The bottom layer is made with an inch of premium support foam to provide durability and lasting support. The next layer is two inches of memory foam for cradling comfort and pressure point relief. We’ve topped it off with a third layer of luxury - a 100% cotton quilted cover that’s filled with plush fiberfill. Open Cell Memory Foam This mattress topper is made with open cell memory foam, allowing for a comfortable sleep temperature. The unique, patented formulation and manufacturing process offers improved airflow for the perfect night’s sleep. Advanced foam technology – open cells provide increased airflow and support Advanced foam technology – open cells provide increased airflow and support Premium memory foam – for optimal recovery and enhanced durability Premium memory foam – for optimal recovery and enhanced durability Product Benefits Medium to medium/plush feel Medium to medium/plush feel Extends the life of any mattress and improves comfort Extends the life of any mattress and improves comfort Memory foam provides cradling comfort and reduces pressure points Memory foam provides cradling comfort and reduces pressure points Open cell technology ensures a comfortable sleep temperature Open cell technology ensures a comfortable sleep temperature Helps rejuvenate tired muscles and eases back pain Helps rejuvenate tired muscles and eases back pain Quick Mattress Transformation To add the topper to your mattress, simply place the foam on your mattress with the 1-inch layer on the bottom. Then, lay the cover on top of the foam and stretch the sides down over the corners of your mattress. Just like that, you’re mattress will receive an instant upgrade that adds years of life and renewed comfort. Topper Construction and Highlights: 100% cotton cover with 1-inch fiberfill for plush comfort 100% cotton cover with 1-inch fiberfill for plush comfort 2-inch memory foam layer provides gentle cradling and alleviates pressure points 2-inch memory foam layer provides gentle cradling and alleviates pressure points 1-inch premium support foam provides stability and therapeutic support to prevent tossing and turning 1-inch premium support foam provides stability and therapeutic support to prevent tossing and turning 10 year, limited warranty 10 year, limited warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81axs0L+N0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serta","source_asin":"B00HWRKTFU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HWRKTFU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HWRKTFU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
