window.products.push({"id":451888,"name":"Laminated Vinyl Decal Symbol to Organize Trash cans or Garbage containers and Walls, Waterproof Indoor and Outdoor,Creative Sticker-Green and Blue. 3\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X0nDWt3BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nowadays, it is important to take care of the environment more than ever. Start this care with yourself and your home. \"How to do it?\" - you ask. The answer is simple: you need to sort the garbage. Yes, you heard it right. By sorting waste, you make a huge contribution to the environment. To become a little more organized in this matter, we created stickers for garbage containers. Your household and you will no longer store everything in one trash can. The ease of sorting garbage and, most importantly, its benefits are the main tasks of recycling and trash stickers. Why is it so essential to buy stickers for your trash can? Garbage can stickers are great for maintaining cleanliness at home and in offices, hotels, bars, restaurants, and even the gym. You can also use the multifunctional stickers on trash bins, garbage trucks, glass windows, cardboard boxes, etc. The trash can stickers are easy to use and apply quickly and smoothly to the surface. Also, the recycling stickers on the trash cans are resistant to any chemical attack, as they have high-quality vinyl protection. Trash can stickers will stay with you for a long time, and most importantly, they will bring significant benefits. If you suddenly decide to remove the recycling trash sticker from your trash can, it will be effortless. Sometimes talking is not enough to involve your friends and acquaintances in waste sorting. Make a creative gift in the form of a set of cool vinyl stickers. Perfect as a practical gift like kitchen supplies for office colleagues, teachers, or grandmothers. They will appreciate your interest in recycling and will be happy to support it. This seemingly small collection of recycling and trash stickers for separate waste collection will save you and your loved ones from worry and do an excellent service to nature that will thank you in the future.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X0nDWt3BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09ZP83SDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-451888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZP83SDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZP83SDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
